#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:41
msgid "My Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:43
msgid ""
"Ever since I was a kid and for many years, spirituality was something I "
"explored through religion. In 2022, my path shifted in a way I never "
"expected. What began as a personal search for meaning became a profound "
"journey inward, one that transformed the way I understand intuition, "
"consciousness and the unseen world."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:45
msgid ""
"Although I had experienced intuitive moments throughout my life, it was "
"during this period that I became fully aware of my own intuitive abilities. "
"Rather than learning tarot through traditional study, I discovered that my "
"relationship with the cards developed naturally through practice, meditation "
"and trust in my own inner guidance."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:47
msgid ""
"Today, tarot has become one of the ways I help others reconnect with "
"themselves. I do not see tarot as a tool that predicts a fixed future."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:49
msgid ""
"To me, every reading is an invitation to better understand the present: to "
"uncover hidden emotional patterns, recognize unconscious dynamics and "
"explore the possibilities that exist within the current moment."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:51
msgid ""
"Our choices, our beliefs and our awareness all shape the paths available to "
"us. Rather than telling you who you are or what must happen, the cards "
"encourage reflection, clarity and empowerment."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:53
msgid ""
"This is why I ask for as little information as possible before each reading. "
"A simple question is often enough. Allowing the cards to speak before the "
"story helps me approach each reading with openness, intuition and as little "
"personal bias as possible. Alongside tarot, I also work with dowsing rods "
"when deeper energetic clarification is needed. They are another intuitive "
"tool that occasionally complements my readings."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:55
msgid ""
"My personal spiritual path is deeply connected to what I describe as the "
"energy of the Dragon Rider. Within my own practice, dragons represent "
"wisdom, transformation, courage and protection. I experience them as "
"spiritual allies who accompany my intuitive work and help me remain "
"connected to my higher self and inner guidance. While every person's "
"spiritual journey is unique, this symbolic relationship forms an important "
"part of mine."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:57
msgid ""
"Above all, my intention is never simply to provide answers. It is to help "
"you understand yourself more deeply."
msgstr ""

#: .\divination_site\core\templates\about.html:59
msgid ""
"My hope is that every reading leaves you with more than guidance, it leaves "
"you feeling clearer, more empowered and more connected to your own path."
msgstr ""

